</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPromissoryNotesDueOnBalanceSheetDateTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※２　有形固定資産の減価償却累計額&lt;/p&gt;
